{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and figure out this strange little command line game. Use all the items in your inventory and outventory to solve each level. Take each mechanic a bit past its conclusion and learn a little bit more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With zero secrets you can take your time and solve all 70 mostly short levels in this completely linear game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made entirely from scratch, so you can get to experience all the quirks and consequences that come along with that, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >strange controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weird music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unfamiliar game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ascii art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a general sense of apathy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a full user manual</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a full copy of the game code for you to look at</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes several vaguely unique items. Here are all of them: <div class=\"bb_code\">AX#oOyYp-C=Rr^~M&gt;&lt;lLbTH,Wj_{}%</div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554590?t=1772591299","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554590/b95f02c7bb8eebbc1935512465fcbb56a55ab79c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772591299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554590/dd6453ee63d9be75588e93af515ae937199a6a56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772591299","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554590/dd6453ee63d9be75588e93af515ae937199a6a56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772591299","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descri